        <div>
          <h3>Official Court Dimensions</h3>
          <p>Every pickleball court we build adheres to USA Pickleball Association standards with precise 20' × 44' playing area dimensions. The court includes a 7-foot non-volley zone (the "kitchen") on each side of the net, creating the strategic elements that make pickleball unique.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Playing surface: 20 feet × 44 feet</li>
            <li>Total recommended space: 30 feet × 60 feet</li>
            <li>Net height: 36 inches at ends, 34 inches at center</li>
            <li>Non-volley zone: 7 feet from net on each side</li>
            <li>Service areas: Two 15' × 10' rectangles per side</li>
            <li>Centerline divides court into left and right service areas</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
